<div class="mandarin-hanzi">休息</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">xiūxi</div>

''Meaning:'' rest; take a break  
''Part of speech:'' verb; noun

!! In context
我们吃完饭以后休息。 — Wǒmen chī wán fàn yǐhòu xiūxi. — We’ll rest after eating.

!! Usage note
Common as a verb ('to rest' or 'take a break'); it can also name a rest period. The second syllable is normally neutral.
